      <div class="announcement-text" style="color: #ffffff;">
        <p>
          <strong>Happy New Year!</strong> 🎆 Cheers to a new year of raising performance and elevating standards. 
          We will be closed on New Year's Day. See you in the morning! 🥂
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
)}

